{"id":9294723,"html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-ras/merge_requests/135","number":135,"state":"open","title":"Preserve unknown dimensions in MatmulAbftVerify InferShape","url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-ras/pulls/135","issue_url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-ras/pulls/135/issues","body":"# Preserve unknown dimensions in MatmulAbftVerify InferShape\n\n`MatmulAbftVerify` advertises dynamic-shape support, but its InferShape callback applies ceil-division to M and N before checking for unknown dimensions. An input dimension of `-1` can therefore produce a zero-length `compRow` shape.\n\nPropagate an unknown output length when M or N is unknown. Host InferShape tests cover dynamic M, dynamic N, and the static shape A[64,128] x B[128,256], whose output length remains 8.\n\n关联 Issue: https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-ras/issues/65","assignees_number":10,"assignees":[{"id":"6822cc0d6a68fa1fec6cc502","login":"zhou-qilong","name":"sunday","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/zhou-qilong","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6880ad5a32fa9627bd89c02f","login":"LiuZonggu","name":"LiuZonggu","avatar_url":"https://cdn-static.gitcode.com/avatars/docs.png","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/LiuZonggu","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822c65e59bdd61f837dbc5a","login":"yu-xinjie62","name":"於欣洁","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/yu-xinjie62","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822dffae4b985165b4b112b","login":"loov1","name":"loov","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/loov1","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822d582053cff786c910efe","login":"rxtfeng","name":"rxtfeng","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/rxtfeng","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822c9d2b3a86414eb5ba3a5","login":"yue-ma","name":"yue-ma","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/yue-ma","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68c0d3b72f80710bcb7e8de5","login":"gubaocheng","name